---
pagination:
  data: cities
  size: 1
  alias: city
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/sell-my-house-fast-{{ city.slug }}-nc/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageType: city
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Sell My House Fast in {{ city.name }}, NC | Cash Offer in {{ site.offerWindowHours }} Hours"
  description: "Need to sell a house fast in {{ city.name }}, NC? We buy houses in {{ city.county }} County as-is. No repairs, no commission, no closing costs. Written cash offer in {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours."
  breadcrumbs:
    - name: "Home"
      url: "/"
    - name: "Areas We Buy"
      url: "/service-areas/"
    - name: "{{ city.name }}, NC"
      url: "/sell-my-house-fast-{{ city.slug }}-nc/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}
{%- set small = city.tier == 3 -%}


<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ city.county }} County, North Carolina</p>
      <h1>Sell My House Fast in {{ city.name }}, NC</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">
        Any condition. Any situation. A written cash offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours,
        and you pick the closing date.
      </p>
      <ul class="hero__points">
        <li>No repairs, we buy {{ city.name }} houses exactly as they stand</li>
        <li>No commission and no closing costs, ever</li>
        <li>Close in {{ site.closeDaysMin }}&ndash;{{ site.closeDaysMax }} days, or later if you need it</li>
        <li>Leave what you don't want, cleanout is on us</li>
        <li>We don't re-trade you on condition, the number doesn't move after you sign</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="hero__trust">
        Prefer to talk it through? Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" style="color:#fff"><strong>{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a>
        or text <a href="sms:{{ site.smsRaw }}" style="color:#fff"><strong>{{ site.smsDisplay }}</strong></a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {{ leadForm("hero-form", "hero", city, null, "What's your " + city.name + " house worth to us?", "Start with the address. Written offer within " + site.offerWindowHours + " hours.", true) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="trust-bar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul>
      <li>Written offers, not verbal estimates</li>
      <li>We walk every property ourselves</li>
      <li>Closed through a NC attorney</li>
      <li>No obligation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <div class="answer-box">
      <p>
        <strong>Can you sell a house fast in {{ city.name }}?</strong> Yes. A cash sale skips the
        two things that make a retail sale slow: lender underwriting and repair negotiations.
        Monthaven buys {{ city.name }} houses directly, as-is, with no financing contingency,
        which means a written offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours and closing in
        {{ site.closeDaysMin }} to {{ site.closeDaysMax }} days at a North Carolina closing attorney.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>We buy houses in {{ city.name }} in any situation</h2>
    <p class="lead mt-4 mb-6">
      Most people who call us aren't trying to squeeze the last dollar out of a house.
      They're trying to get out from under one. These are the situations we see most in
      {{ city.county }} County.
    </p>
    {% if small %}
    <ul class="pill-links">
      {% for s in situations %}<li><a href="/{{ s.urlPrefix }}-nc/">{{ s.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    {{ b.situationGrid(city) }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-6">How selling to us works</h2>
    {% if small %}
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div><h3>Tell us about the house</h3><p>Address and what's going on. One call to
      {{ site.phoneDisplay }}, or the form.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>We drive out and walk it with you</h3><p>{{ city.name }} is a short drive and we
      would rather see a property than price it off a screen. Don't clean up on our account.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>Written offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours</h3><p>With the math behind it,
      and no obligation.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>You pick the closing date</h3><p>Usually {{ site.closeDaysMin }} to
      {{ site.closeDaysMax }} days, at a North Carolina closing attorney.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-5"><a href="/how-it-works/">The full process, including how we price an offer &rarr;</a></p>
    {% else %}
    {{ b.howItWorks(city) }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">The one thing we won't do to you</h2>
    {{ b.noRetradePromise(small) }}
    {{ b.twoNumberPromise(true) }}
    <div class="mt-6">{{ b.guarantee(true) }}</div>
    {% if small %}<p class="mt-4"><a href="/how-it-works/">What can and can't change after you sign &rarr;</a></p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Cash offer vs. listing with an agent in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    {% if small %}
    <p>
      No commission, no seller closing costs, no repairs, no showings, and no financing that can
      fall through, against a price below what a retail sale would bring if your house is
      sound and you can wait for it. That is the whole trade, and in a market as thin as
      {{ city.name }}'s the waiting is the part worth thinking hardest about.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4"><a href="/compare/">The full comparison, line by line &rarr;</a></p>
    {% else %}
    {{ b.comparison(city) }}
    {{ b.valueStack() }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Houses we've bought near {{ city.name }}</h2>
    {{ b.caseStudies(city.slug) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-5">What {{ city.name }} sellers say</h2>
    {{ b.testimonials(city.slug) }}
  </div>
</section>

{#- The genuinely local section. This is what every competitor fakes. -#}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>About the {{ city.name }} housing market</h2>

    <p>{{ city.housingStock }}</p>

    <p>{{ city.whyWeBuyHere }}</p>

    <h3>Who sells to us in {{ city.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ city.sellerProfile }}</p>

    <h3>What makes a {{ city.name }} house hard to sell the normal way</h3>
    <p>{{ city.localChallenges }}</p>

    {% if city.localDetail %}<p>{{ city.localDetail }}</p>{% endif %}

    {% if city.unincorporatedNote %}<p>{{ city.unincorporatedNote }}</p>{% endif %}

    {% if city.medianHomeValue %}
    <p>
      As of {{ city.marketDataAsOf }}, the median home value in {{ city.name }} is around
      {{ city.medianHomeValue | usd }}{% if city.medianDaysOnMarket %}, with homes averaging
      about {{ city.medianDaysOnMarket }} days on market{% endif %}{% if city.monthsInventory %}
      and roughly {{ city.monthsInventory }} months of inventory{% endif %}.
      {% if city.marketDataSource %}<span class="small muted">(Source: {{ city.marketDataSource }}.)</span>{% endif %}
      Those are averages across the whole city, though, and they include renovated houses.
      A house that needs a roof, a system, or structural work does not sell at the median,
      which is the gap a cash offer is actually priced against.
    </p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if city.housingUnits %}
    <p>
      Some context most buyers working this market never look up. {{ city.name }} has about
      {{ city.housingUnits }} housing units in total{% if city.population %} and a population
      near {{ city.population }}{% endif %}{% if city.ownerOccupiedPct %}, roughly
      {{ city.ownerOccupiedPct }}% of them owner-occupied{% endif %}{% if city.medianHouseholdIncome %},
      against a median household income of {{ city.medianHouseholdIncome | usd }}{% endif %}.
      <span class="small muted">(Source: {{ city.censusAsOf }}.)</span>
      Those two numbers together explain more about how long a house sits here than any
      price chart does: the pool of local buyers who can get a loan on your house is
      small, and it shrinks fast as the price goes up.
    </p>
    {% endif %}

    <p>
      We buy across
      {% for z in city.zips %}{{ z }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %},
      including
      {% for n in city.neighborhoods %}{{ n }}{% if loop.revindex == 2 %} and {% elif not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.
      {% if city.landmarks.length %}If you're anywhere near
      {% for l in city.landmarks | limit(3) %}{{ l }}{% if loop.revindex == 2 %} or {% elif not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %},
      we know the area.{% endif %}
      {% if city.countySeat %}{{ city.name }} is the {{ city.county }} County seat, so estate,
      probate, and foreclosure matters for the whole county run through here.{% else %}
      Probate and foreclosure matters for {{ city.name }} are handled at the
      {{ city.courthouse }}.{% endif %}
      Homes here are served by {{ city.schoolDistrict }}.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">{{ city.name }} sellers ask us</h2>
    {{ b.faqList(faqItems) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">We also buy houses near {{ city.name }}</h2>
    {{ b.nearbyCities(city) }}
    {#- Only Gaston and Cleveland have hub pages; Lincoln has one city and would be thin. -#}
    {% set hub = counties | findBySlug(city.county | lower) %}
    <p class="mt-5">
      {% if hub %}<a href="/we-buy-houses-{{ hub.slug }}-county-nc/">Everything we buy in {{ city.county }} County</a> &middot; {% endif %}
      <a href="/service-areas/">See every city we buy in</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand("Get a cash offer on your " + city.name + " house", "Start with the address. You'll have a written offer within " + site.offerWindowHours + " hours, and there's no obligation to take it.") }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    {{ leadForm("bottom-form", "full", city, null, "Get your " + city.name + " cash offer") }}
  </div>
</section>
